	(text "EARTH / PE\n- Mains inlet earth ALSO goes direct to chassis via the existing strap.\n  The PCB is NOT the only earth path.\n- C30, C31 = Y-caps L/N to PE (EMI). C32 + R32 = soft link 0V to PE.\n- C30, C31, C32 MUST be Y2 safety rated. Do not substitute.\n- H1 bonds board PE to chassis via a mounting screw (use star washer).\n- PE tracks >= 3 mm wide."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.4 193.04 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "90f9b7b2-95c9-4c30-b385-93b485671433"))
